    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30389d5d018ac3f4e5b3db93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥带着明确目标努力累积实力，自己却\n不像她那样能够毫无迷惘地前进。伏特加带着\n这种心情……决定下个目标是“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4f2b3c0eafda8841db3cd03d061f40a0f8206cefbcff92ac68d0060877722d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
