    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b01946c69b4e09df7ee48287",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋华赏结束后・为胜利陶醉",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0fadde8f49f28c7ed9e13192a94b5642b9362ba117ab78d0057eb1b6b59f2be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb2de74b770e5576dd94dd35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“秋华赏”这场难分轩轾的激烈比赛\n由大和赤骥获得优胜。\n她展现出超越伏特加的成长幅度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12cf49d412a75284a4990ff6b25355c00669fc08a044be27eb0aceb6037334f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c221efe5f97ae7489d346a5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束后，大和赤骥挑衅伏特加，\n声称“有马纪念”仍然是自己会赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4672dacffc00af25058a0a3db52081b1ad30b8767df8f95f6ba619e6b7cadf22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7134f63ce36ddc5f7db614a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着，她告知伏特加，“有马纪念”前\n她会先参加“伊丽莎白女王杯”。\n说完就离开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e0e981a0eb0c1af03f04e1bc99e38b8a6b9f6d4f77225a8660148a42fab02c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3484f7cbbf26240f354db1a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥带着明确目标努力累积实力，自己却\n不像她那样能够毫无迷惘地前进。伏特加带着\n这种心情……决定下个目标是“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4f2b3c0eafda8841db3cd03d061f40a0f8206cefbcff92ac68d0060877722d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd1b90c24e4a37e9b6cebc11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋华赏结束后・Bad Dreamin'",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e9ceee54f86ca21b720b35249124bfe0ddb57cfd32b30dec7ac26405a95696",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8e2246f255ec2333ad8075c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赢得比赛，成功当上女王的是伏特加！\n她获得命令对方的权力，\n开心地对大和赤骥下令。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7da564736544ed913dc4b1c3e882277aa73d64b9a39b1098a64fbf3fa39784",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fec70ef7714ddb2cfda761f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥听到令她备感屈辱的命令内容，\n不禁勃然大怒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43dcc78b9ded45078198ac5ea3c69768edd4e44c91148254a66e616aa69c441a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94289869fb76f9a8a2ae2a88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伊丽莎白女王杯结束后・暴虐女王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48dd34b69d77254d076f6e0a1d4c9daca9c5fcc2a5d3a3399f10e471f643dec6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b37b5debeeb468cd3b67398e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "获得胜利，成功当上女王的是大和赤骥。\n她命令伏特加当一整天女仆，辛勤工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef33ad48d82b21348078dd3683887c5e4405a7e8eb0051f02642cc3cdbbbe210",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:842e11bf0acbccbb85fdf8b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加觉得太过羞耻，完全拒绝服从此命令。\n大和赤骥无奈之下只好说出真正的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4010145e7773dfd030099250781a4b6dd69d554d5981285bae0bbba477cc1af8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc93dab8de6519efb08a7cee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加听到她说出“你要一直当我的劲敌”\n这句话……顿时畏缩了一下，叫大和赤骥\n不要突然这么认真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "899f8d518be3aeb74468197935cadfd9ed87e4fc4cfc76e713d360eac663e879",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd02e69f392af0796cf8833",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伊丽莎白女王杯结束后・冷傲女王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d74d1bd015d581576bc5be934416eb7223834c173f278407e70f445f00b86025",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4738b8bd58c9d53eb56e7401",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加在大舞台上赢过大和赤骥。\n但在今天的比赛却无法\n让她感受到从前那股热忱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f992aa6370d0cfb2ecef79651c55eea1f6feee2c122e2ac9eddc97f3d7f7f81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5a4a3cd3174f2e2db1de00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加感到自己无法就这样继续战斗下去，\n她惊觉现在该做的是明确找出\n自己追寻的那份帅气，并将之深化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3018a36a9911be9d35c1d664a4ac118e647d02b1686a71c998654807d7f6c323",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0675e32efebb6573991761c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员建议她参加\n能以速度正面对决的英里竞赛──\n“维多利亚英里赛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e80cec20d8b2b459dcb0fba6c4590d4eba9a0045bda3c2d3776a4b7fc4e48902",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2b24837301f4af8b7319b00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加决定，到比赛之前要利用这段时间……\n好好摸索自己该追寻的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8853accd2a354236e16e234623510b5ff5bd9ce94ffa8e4071fd6d1155f27e4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfca374325b9432d368fb98f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・如砂砾般的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "604e35aa921cc44413ad91b137a69755f8e18c0a6572bcfe95a24e1ccf5514e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b666941cb09ee0a0cc3a9fa6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加输给了大和赤骥。但她坦承\n比起输赢，更严重的是自己“没有理想”，\n所以败北也是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ac53bafa37f097396b078ec899081dcd4f1d3c7e8b390416f9b69701b253c65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70e9db77e15e31e31205597",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加感到自己无法就这样继续战斗下去，\n她惊觉现在该做的是明确找出\n自己追寻的那份帅气，并将之深化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3018a36a9911be9d35c1d664a4ac118e647d02b1686a71c998654807d7f6c323",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008432.json",
