    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c995ee2d18654281369a720c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・迷失的开始",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe53b9383ed7796dec93880f9122231bf5d22153bfcc999df23c9b7056ee5ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17037448059f857481ad0f1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“维多利亚英里赛”上，\n伏特加在最后的直线赛道展现惊人的冲刺力，\n令会场兴奋沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44333f0402d0d8985feb206b66e17cda0cda7ff904a852a922250a8a3b943e3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4897cb7f4210262660b10f63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加迷上这种一瞬间甩开所有赛马娘的\n帅气表现，沉醉其中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6585425d5f8efa0195099952f1ea566131b0335299b2815f108871a3a584c3aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f9d67f1db74e097bebc2a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加认定了冲刺力正是自己在追寻的武器。\n为了更加精进这股力量，\n她决定进军“安田纪念”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "049d2769a8b1f4262129b385d6ed68651c20ed6451c89379bb9a3b1fefa81337",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
